# Code identity of the X570 tree that ran Experiment 2x2
#
# Captured 2026-08-27 after Experiment P finished and before 2x2 launched.
#
# This is the FIRST campaign whose runtime.py is NOT 139b944^. It carries
# the max_steps_per_round flag, which is the experiment's own factor:
#   --max-steps-per-round 1  reproduces the old code path exactly
#     (_step_budget returns all-1 and the tick loop runs one iteration),
#     so the barrier-on column is commensurable with A, A2, A3 and P;
#   --max-steps-per-round 8  is the fix under test.
#
# policies.py additionally carries deadline_quota, the six-action policy.
# run_amd_matrix_cell.py carries the new flag plus four literal-percent
# escapes in pre-existing help strings that had made --help crash since
# before this campaign; the fix is help text only.
#
